  {"i":2556,"t":["qualities"],"n":"Abstract 'dwell/exist within'; the 'lodge' sense is literary and travel units teach 泊まる, so no sense entry."},
  {"i":2569,"t":["routine","communication"],"n":"用 is a personal errand or something to do, used when declining or explaining plans; not workplace vocabulary."},
  {"i":2594,"t":["actions","body"],"n":"An idiom for 'see/witness' taught as an action; the body/senses link is secondary."},
  {"i":2598,"t":["movement"],"s":{"6":["health"]},"n":"Main sense is descending. The diarrhea sense (お腹が下る) is a learner-relevant health sense of a different topic."},
  {"i":2603,"t":["work"],"n":"Achieving goals (目標を達成する) is taught with work; it is not a descriptive quality."},
  {"i":2623,"t":["function","feelings"],"n":"A casual interjection of agreement or triumph, not a polite set phrase."},
  {"i":2659,"t":["thinking","law"],"n":"'Clue' is the main sense and is typical of police investigation, so law goes in t; a sense entry for the main sense would be redundant."},
  {"i":2661,"t":["work","travel"],"s":{"2":["law"]},"n":"Arranging is common at work and for tickets and hotels; a police search (指名手配) is a distinct law sense."},
  {"i":2677,"t":["relationships","clothing"],"n":"Used of well-matched couples and very commonly of clothes (よくお似合いです); character is a loose fit."},
  {"i":2681,"t":["actions","body"],"n":"An idiom for 'catch sight of' taught as an action; the body/senses link is secondary."},
  {"i":2686,"t":["communication"],"n":"Appealing or making a display is communication; the 'attractiveness' sense refers to things in general, not personality."}
