  {"i":2559,"keep":[6],"n":"上下 as a two-piece outfit (上下セット) is common in clothing; up-and-down fluctuation is not really a movement-unit word"},
  {"i":2560,"keep":[2],"n":"〜年越し (e.g. 10年越しの夢) is a common N3 time expression"},
  {"i":2578,"keep":[3],"n":"睨む meaning to suspect (犯人だと睨む) is a common usage that fits thinking"},
  {"i":2586,"keep":[1],"n":"Withdrawing from a deal or project is the main idiomatic sense and fits business"},
  {"i":2588,"keep":[2],"n":"後にする meaning to put off (それは後にしよう) is very common and is a time word"},
  {"i":2598,"keep":[6],"n":"お腹が下る (diarrhea) is a common everyday health expression"},
  {"i":2605,"keep":[2],"n":"Biology as a school subject belongs in school as well as science"},
  {"i":2608,"keep":[6],"n":"〜割り for drinks (水割り, ウーロン割り) is common and taught with drinks"},
  {"i":2610,"keep":[2],"n":"To grumble (愚痴をこぼす) is a common sense that fits communication"},
  {"i":2611,"keep":[2],"n":"To tweet or post is now a common everyday sense that fits technology"},
  {"i":2612,"keep":[2],"n":"遥か昔 (long ago) is common and is a time expression"},
  {"i":2619,"keep":[],"n":"草 as LOL is internet slang, not taught at this level"},
  {"i":2632,"keep":[4],"n":"The counter 一発 or 〜発 for shots and blows is common and belongs in measures"},
  {"i":2636,"keep":[2],"n":"警察に突き出す is a set phrase taught with police and crime"},
  {"i":2637,"keep":[],"n":"A bleak future is a figurative extension, not a feelings-unit word"},
  {"i":2649,"keep":[2],"n":"食える or 食えない meaning able to make a living is common colloquially and fits work and money"},
